    "thessvane_product_story": {
      "type": "thessvane-product-story",
      "blocks": {
        "row_formula": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image_caption": "Every formula starts as a short ingredient list.",
            "eyebrow": "The Formula",
            "heading": "Built Around Your Skin Barrier",
            "text": "<p>A short list of naturally derived actives, balanced so they support each other instead of competing for room. No synthetic fragrance, no sulfates, no filler padding out the bottle.</p><p>Every batch is dermatologist-tested for daily use, which means it slots into the routine you already have rather than replacing it.</p>",
            "note_icon": "✱",
            "note_label": "Good to know",
            "note_text": "Fragrance-free and non-comedogenic, so it layers cleanly under SPF or makeup.",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_feel": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image_caption": "Sinks in fast — no residue, no waiting around.",
            "eyebrow": "The Feel",
            "heading": "Absorbs In Seconds, Not Minutes",
            "text": "<p>Light enough to disappear into skin, rich enough that you won't be reaching for it again an hour later. No tacky film, no white cast, nothing transferring onto your clothes.</p>",
            "note_icon": "✱",
            "note_label": "Try this",
            "note_text": "Apply to slightly damp skin — it spreads further and absorbs faster.",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_results": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image_caption": "Same light, same angle, four weeks apart.",
            "eyebrow": "The Results",
            "heading": "Give It Four Weeks",
            "text": "<p>Skin turns over roughly every 28 days, so that's the honest window for judging any formula. Most people notice texture softening in the first week or two, with tone evening out towards the end of the first month.</p><p>Use it daily, take a photo on day one, and compare in the same light four weeks later.</p>",
            "note_icon": "✱",
            "note_label": "Heads up",
            "note_text": "If your skin runs reactive, patch test on your inner arm for 24 hours before the first full application.",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "row_formula",
        "row_feel",
        "row_results"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "The Details",
        "title": "What It Actually Does",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "description": "<p>The formula, the feel and the timeline — laid out plainly so you know exactly what you're buying.</p>",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-2",
