    "collapsible_content_VV38cX": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "row_ingredients": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients & Sourcing",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Naturally derived actives, plant oils and humectants. The complete INCI list is printed on every carton and shown in the product images above.</p><p>We leave out synthetic fragrance, sulfates, parabens and mineral oil across the whole line. Formulated and filled in small batches, and never tested on animals.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "row_suitability": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is It Right For My Skin?",
            "icon": "heart",
            "row_content": "<p>Suitable for normal, dry, oily and combination skin, and non-comedogenic so it won't block pores. If your skin is sensitive or reactive, patch test on your inner arm for 24 hours before the first full application.</p><p>Pregnant, breastfeeding, or already using a prescription retinoid or acid treatment? Check with your doctor before adding anything new to your routine.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "row_using": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Long Will One Bottle Last?",
            "icon": "bottle",
            "row_content": "<p>Used once daily as directed, a full-size bottle lasts most people around eight to ten weeks — roughly two full skin cycles, which is long enough to judge the results properly.</p><p>Store it somewhere cool and out of direct sunlight, and use it within twelve months of opening.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "row_shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & Returns",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Orders are packed within one to two business days. Delivery estimates for your address are calculated at checkout.</p><p>Not the right fit? Our full returns policy is linked in the footer — start a return there and we'll take it from the top.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "row_ingredients",
        "row_suitability",
        "row_using",
        "row_shipping"
      ],
